  "statement": "Consider these two operations: \\[\\begin{align*} a\\,\\blacklozenge\\,b &= a^2 - b^2 \\\\ a \\star b &= (a - b)^2 \\end{align*}\\]\n\nCompute the value:\n\n\\[ (5\\,\\blacklozenge\\,3) \\star 6 \\]",
