    {
      "id": "sol.amc-8-2022-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Using the definitions, \\[\\begin{align*} (5\\,\\blacklozenge\\,3) \\star 6 &= (5^2-3^2) \\star 6 \\\\ &=16 \\star 6 \\\\ &=(16-6)^2\\\\ &= 100\\end{align*}\\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is D.",
